    "captions": [
      {
        "text": "Open Video Studio.",
        "startMs": 200,
        "endMs": 1305
      },
      {
        "text": "Turn on Match the reference pacing.",
        "startMs": 1305,
        "endMs": 3452
      },
      {
        "text": "Upload your presenter video, then upload one reference video.",
        "startMs": 3452,
        "endMs": 7196
      },
      {
        "text": "Name the project, add your script, and confirm",
        "startMs": 7196,
        "endMs": 10019
      },
      {
        "text": "you have the rights to edit your footage.",
        "startMs": 10019,
        "endMs": 12535
      },
      {
        "text": "After analysis, Lumen measures the reference",
        "startMs": 13367,
        "endMs": 16103
      },
      {
        "text": "and builds a timeline from your footage.",
        "startMs": 16103,
        "endMs": 18591
      },
      {
        "text": "You do not place cuts, zooms, or graphics by hand.",
        "startMs": 18591,
        "endMs": 21701
      },
      {
        "text": "The reference is measured only.",
        "startMs": 21701,
        "endMs": 23630
      },
      {
        "text": "Its pictures do not enter the finished file.",
        "startMs": 23630,
        "endMs": 26366
      },
      {
        "text": "The cut follows the reference rhythm: shot length, zooms,",
        "startMs": 27167,
        "endMs": 30945
      },
      {
        "text": "color, captions, and charts from numbers in your script.",
        "startMs": 30945,
        "endMs": 34657
      },
      {
        "text": "A screen-like shot holds your frame.",
        "startMs": 34657,
        "endMs": 37044
      },
      {
        "text": "An illustration uses your words.",
        "startMs": 37044,
        "endMs": 39165
      },
      {
        "text": "If the reference asks for B-roll, one Commons clip may be",
        "startMs": 39165,
        "endMs": 42944
      },
      {
        "text": "added, and only with a CC BY, CC0, or public-domain license.",
        "startMs": 42944,
        "endMs": 46921
      },
      {
        "text": "The credit stays on the asset.",
        "startMs": 46921,
        "endMs": 48910
      },
      {
        "text": "Watch the result.",
        "startMs": 49733,
        "endMs": 50763
      },
      {
        "text": "Choose Approve this cut when it is right.",
        "startMs": 50763,
        "endMs": 53248
      },
      {
        "text": "Choose Regenerate video to rebuild the whole cut.",
        "startMs": 53248,
        "endMs": 56217
      },
      {
        "text": "Choose a section, then Regenerate selected section, to rebuild only that part.",
        "startMs": 56217,
        "endMs": 60944
      },
      {
        "text": "The manual editor stays on the page, so",
        "startMs": 60944,
        "endMs": 63307
      },
      {
        "text": "you can still change a shot yourself.",
        "startMs": 63307,
        "endMs": 65549
      },
      {
        "text": "If a chart needs a number, put that number in your script.",
        "startMs": 66367,
        "endMs": 69864
      },
      {
        "text": "Nothing is invented.",
        "startMs": 69864,
        "endMs": 71071
      },
      {
        "text": "If no Commons clip matches your words under those licenses,",
        "startMs": 71071,
        "endMs": 74629
      },
      {
        "text": "the report says so and the video still renders.",
        "startMs": 74629,
        "endMs": 77463
      },
      {
        "text": "Face tracking and a complex room background are not copied.",
        "startMs": 77463,
        "endMs": 81021
      },
      {
        "text": "Download the file, reload, and download again:",
        "startMs": 81021,
        "endMs": 83795
      },
      {
        "text": "both files are the same finished cut.",
        "startMs": 83795,
        "endMs": 86027
      }
    ]
  },
